e. Every player of a club moves by one whole number and its best few by one more, held to 1–99 and never past a teammate rated above him, whichever brings the club nearest its target: −3 to +4 points this season. The results count twice, by design: the credit's points for and against place a club's players at their positions and weigh its offence against its defence, and the move then sets the club's level from its margins, wherever the credit left it. Facts from Pro Football Archives; the weights tuned once on 2001–2005 against the next season's Madden launch ratings, then frozen."},"map":"nfl1996","clubs":[{"id":"nfl-green-bay-packers","name":"Green Bay Packers","code":"GBP","league":"NFL","country":"840","col":"oklch(0.72 0.16 198)","str":84.7,"squad":[["Brett Favre","QB",97],["Jim McMahon","QB",54],["Edgar Bennett","RB",85],["Dorsey Levens","RB",76],["Antonio Freeman","WR",80],["Don Beebe","WR",74],["Robert Brooks","WR",74],["Terry Mickens","WR",68],["Mark Chmura","TE",80],["Keith Jackson","TE",73],["Aaron Taylor","OL",97],["Adam Timmerman","OL",97],["Frank Winters","OL",97],["Earl Dotson","OL",87],["John Michels","OL",65],["Gary Brown","OL",60],["Bruce Wilkerson","OL",57],["Reggie White","DL",93],["Santana Dotson","DL",84],["Sean Jones","DL",83],["Gilbert Brown","DL",75],["Gabe Wilkins","DL",63],["Keith McKenzie","DL",59],["George Koonce","LB",87],["Wayne Simmons","LB",87],["Brian Williams","LB",85],["Doug Evans","CB",98],["Craig Newsome","CB",81],["Corey Dowden","CB",61],["Tyrone Williams","CB",59],["LeRoy Butler","S",97],["Eugene Robinson","S",92],["Mike Prior","S",57],["Chris Jacke","K",77]]},{"id":"nfl-san-francisco-49ers","name":"San Francisco 49ers","code":"SFO","league":"NFL","country":"840","col":"oklch(0.72 0.16 43)","str":83.7,"squad":[["Steve Young","QB",86],["Elvis Grbac","QB",67],["Terry Kirby","RB",83],["William Floyd","RB",75],["Jerry Rice","WR",93],["Terrell Owens","WR",75],["J.J. Stokes","WR",69],["Iheanyi Uwaezuoke","WR",63],["Brent Jones","TE